{"id":338,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"IB探究で自立した札幌開成を育てる","feature_description":"札幌市立札幌開成中等教育学校は、6年間の課題探究的学習を通して、自立した札幌人を育てる学校です。IBやSSH、多文化理解を視野に入れた学びを進め、主体的に課題へ向き合う力を重視しています。公立中等教育としての特色が見えやすいです。 公式サイトの学校生活や行事の導線も整っており、比較用に必要な情報を確認しやすいです。入学後の姿も想像しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6046,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6047,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6048,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6049,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6050,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6051,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6052,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6053,"name":"男子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6054,"name":"女子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www23.sapporo-c.ed.jp/sapporo-kaisei/index.cfm/10%2C2103%2Cc%2Chtml/2103/20250411-191515.pdf","verified_at":"202